 | SCENARIO-KAN-5304 | Dynamic Refinement Tightens Diagnostics Without Overclaiming Scope | Implemented | Artifact follows the bounded offline deterministic certificate path over Exp5277, Exp5278, and Exp5291 fixtures, compares static abstraction, low-order Exp5291 reuse, and dynamic spot-check refinement, and records dynamic diagnostic gains: spot-check hit rate 0.8888888889 versus 0.008 for static/low-order, dynamic_hit_rate_delta=0.8808888889, global_error_bound 0.00375 versus 0.015, and dynamic_envelope_gap_reduction=0.01125. All compared methods still certify the bounded true property and reject the nearby false property, but success_improvement=0.0 and bounded_scope_only.value=true keep the claim limited to diagnostic tightness and spot-check targeting rather than a certificate-success or global KAN-verifier win. |
 | REQ-HW-5305 | Hardware-continuity v484 MUST record status-only KV260, PolarFire, and GateMate evidence with no speedup claim | Scaffolding | `python/carnot/experiment_5305_hardware_continuity_reachability_v484.py`; `tests/python/test_experiment_5305_hardware_continuity_reachability_v484.py`; `openspec/capabilities/fpga/spec.md`; `results/experiment_5305_hardware_continuity_reachability_v484.json`; honest_verdict={"principle":"Terminal verdict starts with complete: or blocked_ and states KV260, PolarFire, GateMate, and no-speedup outcomes.","value":"blocked_board_reachability: kv260=blocked_kv260_ssh_unreachable polarfire=reachable_ssh_status_only gatemate=blocked_gatemate_physical_jtag_setup_unchanged no_speedup_claim"}; status=<missing>; kv260_status=blocked_kv260_ssh_unreachable exit_code=255; polarfire_status=reachable_ssh_status_only exit_code=0 ssh_reachable=true; gatemate_status=blocked_gatemate_physical_jtag_setup_unchanged; hardware_speedup_claimed.value=false; no retro_* flags; no AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement/violation_rate fields; blocked board reachability/status-only evidence is recorded without workload or speedup success. |
 | SCENARIO-HW-5305 | Exp 5305 writes a v484 reachability/status-only hardware-continuity receipt | Scaffolding | Artifact follows the blocked reachability/status-only path: KV260 SSH is unreachable with exit_code=255, PolarFire SSH status-only is reachable with exit_code=0, GateMate USB is visible but physical/JTAG setup is unchanged, and hardware_speedup_claimed.value=false. The scenario is not marked implemented because honest_verdict.value starts with `blocked_board_reachability`; no retro closure, AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement, violation_rate, workload timing, flashing, or speedup claim is recorded. |
+| REQ-CAPSTONE-5306 | V484 Milestone-Close Capstone Synthesis | Scaffolding | `python/carnot/experiment_5306_capstone_v484.py`; `tests/python/test_experiment_5306_capstone_v484.py`; `openspec/capabilities/capstone/spec.md`; `results/experiment_5306_capstone_v484.json`; honest_verdict={"principle":"terminal prefix; starts with complete: or blocked_ and summarizes the .484 milestone without laundering gated, blocked, null, harmful, mixed, quarantined, missing, or no-speedup evidence.","value":"complete: .484 closed with changed-runtime SOTA still blocked and quality unmeasured, adaptive memory/self-learning cleanly positive, solver/certificate tracks bounded with LNS and p-bit gates but quarantined EBT telemetry and null certificate-success lift, and hardware reachability-only with no speedup."}; status=null; tasks_summarized expected_count=11 loadable_count=11 clean_positive=4 clean_null=1 blocked_precondition=2 gated_skip=1 mixed_positive_with_harmful_class=1 quarantined=2; no retro_* flags; no AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement/violation_rate fields; mapped ⚠️ Blocked because honest_verdict contains `blocked` and preserves quality-unmeasured, quarantined telemetry, null certificate-success lift, and no-speedup hardware evidence. |
+| SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-5306 | Artifact Preserves V484 Positives, Nulls, Gates, Quarantines, Mixed Harm, And Blocks | Scaffolding | Artifact summarizes Exp5295 through Exp5305 with expected_count=11, loadable_count=11, clean_positive=4, clean_null=1, blocked_precondition=2, gated_skip=1, mixed_positive_with_harmful_class=1, and quarantined=2; it records adaptive memory avoided 3/7 full checks at rate_vs_always_full=0.428571, p-bit/CDCL solver_only_vs_gated conflicts_saved=9, dynamic abstraction envelope_gap_reduction=0.01125, changed-runtime SOTA blocked with no quality claim, and hardware_speedup_claimed=false. No retro closure, AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement/violation_rate metric, SOTA quality result, hardware speedup, or complete capstone win is claimed. |
+| SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-5306-BLOCKED-MISSING-INPUT | Missing Upstream Artifacts Fail Closed | Scaffolding | Spec and tests cover the `blocked_missing_required` path; Exp 5306 loaded all expected artifacts with expected_count=11 and loadable_count=11, but the scenario remains fail-closed scaffolding rather than an implemented win. The completed artifact still maps ⚠️ Blocked because the terminal honest_verdict preserves blocked SOTA runtime, quality-unmeasured SOTA smoke, quarantined telemetry, null certificate-success lift, and reachability-only no-speedup hardware evidence. |
+| SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-5306-FIELD-PRINCIPLES | Required Anti-Laundering Field Principles | Scaffolding | Artifact records required top-level principle wrappers, including the terminal honest_verdict principle forbidding laundering of gated, blocked, null, harmful, mixed, quarantined, missing, or no-speedup evidence. Status remains ⚠️ Blocked because the field principles preserve blocked/gated/quarantined/null/no-speedup evidence rather than promoting the milestone synthesis to completion. |
